            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/487568?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Bot-based backport to <code class=\"notranslate\">staging-25.11</code>, triggered by a label in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3778491471\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/476704\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/476704/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/476704\">#476704</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Before merging, ensure that this backport is <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#changes-acceptable-for-releases\">acceptable for the release</a>.</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Even as a non-committer, if you find that it is not acceptable, leave a comment.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-tip\" dir=\"auto\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\" dir=\"auto\"><svg class=\"octicon octicon-light-bulb mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 1.5c-2.363 0-4 1.69-4 3.75 0 .984.424 1.625.984 2.304l.214.253c.223.264.47.556.673.848.284.411.537.896.621 1.49a.75.75 0 0 1-1.484.211c-.04-.282-.163-.547-.37-.847a8.456 8.456 0 0 0-.542-.68c-.084-.1-.173-.205-.268-.32C3.201 7.75 2.5 6.766 2.5 5.25 2.5 2.31 4.863 0 8 0s5.5 2.31 5.5 5.25c0 1.516-.701 2.5-1.328 3.259-.095.115-.184.22-.268.319-.207.245-.383.453-.541.681-.208.3-.33.565-.37.847a.751.751 0 0 1-1.485-.212c.084-.593.337-1.078.621-1.489.203-.292.45-.584.673-.848.075-.088.147-.173.213-.253.561-.679.985-1.32.985-2.304 0-2.06-1.637-3.75-4-3.75ZM5.75 12h4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5ZM6 15.25a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75Z\"></path></svg>Tip</p><p dir=\"auto\">If you maintain all packages touched by this pull request, and they are al